<h1>Your trial is ending soon ⏳</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.email %>,</p>

<p>
  Your StudioFlow <strong><%= @tier_label %></strong> trial ends in
  <strong><%= @days_left %> day<%= @days_left == 1 ? '' : 's' %></strong>.
</p>

<p>
  To keep enjoying all the features you've been using — unlimited clients,
  analytics, payout tracking, and more — please add a payment method before your
  trial expires.
</p>

<a href="<%= @billing_url %>" class="btn">Manage your subscription</a>

<p style="font-size:13px">If you have any questions, just reply to this email — we're happy to help.</p>

<% content_for :footer do %>
  You received this email because your StudioFlow trial is ending soon.
<% end %>
